step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Travel to Miscellania (Either go to Rellekka middle dock to travel by sailor or fairy code: CIP)</str>
line	
line	<str>If you do not have flowers yet, buy some from the Flower Girl in the castle courtyard for 15gp.</str>
